  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-skin-glass",
      "text": "A frosted-glass skin plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI.\n\n- 🖼️ Set any wallpaper — it auto-generates light/dark design tokens from the dominant color\n- 💎 True per-component `backdrop-filter` glass with adaptive scrim and mirror-edge highlights\n- 🌈 No wallpaper? An automatic gradient glass keeps the frosted look\n- 👓 Readability floor: WCAG AA body contrast at any translucency level\n\n| Light | Dark |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:noexcs/dsh-skin-glass\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "```bash\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-skin-glass\n```"
    },
    {
